An attributed cell keeps its attributes and its literal marker

```
| a | b |
|{.x} < |{.y} ^ |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td class="x">&lt;</td><td class="y">^</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |
| c | < |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
    <tr><td colspan="2">c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
